DOM: XML documents through the Document Object Model API, with libxml2
of the package az.

The module dom of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20230831/dom.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its headers in
include/php83/php/ext/dom.
